# — nothing below twins them.
#
# The skipped-tracks toast is a plural PAIR, per the convention already set by
# "Scan complete ({} file skipped)" and "{} duplicate skipped": the queue build
# drops N rows at once, and a singular-only string reads wrong in every locale
